ex:TK8_BuildVerify_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch19-page/logs_v9_97_1: material check 8 of 8 pass; manifest self-check pass; story layout pass at every viewport; page test 70 features ran and passed, 0 failed. NOT VERIFIED: the page test crashes the browser tab in its phone-size step (tab sparql) on every run, so the checks after that step did not run (phone and tablet layout, accessibility scan of the later panes, light theme, no sideways scroll, audit zip). The same crash happens on the Chapter 18 page, so it comes from this sandbox browser or the test, not from this page; cause not found. Carried into the closure report as a missing item." .
ex:ST8_BuildCh19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 2.2.0, page 9.97.1 and checks done; the unverified remainder of the page test is recorded on the verify task." .
